# Secrets — never read

Agents **must never** read, print, commit, or paraphrase:

- `.env`, `.env.*` (except `.env.example`)
- `config/production.env`, `config/production_email_config.env`
- `*.pem`, `*.key`, `id_rsa*`, `*credentials*.json`, `*firebase-adminsdk*.json`, `serviceAccount*.json`
- Values of `SECRET_KEY`, `*_API_KEY`, `MAIL_PASSWORD`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `LEGISLAI_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, DB passwords

## Allowed

- `.env.example`, `config/production.env.template`, `config/*.example`
- Variable **names** only (e.g. “set `GEMINI_API_KEY` in `.env`”)

## If blocked or asked

Refuse. Point to templates. Do not work around hooks with alternate tools or shell tricks (`cat`, `printenv`, Python `os.environ` dumps of secrets).
